<h2>Product Description</h2>

<p>The Opentrons Thermocycler Module is a fully automated on-deck thermocycler, providing hands-free PCR in a 96-well plate format. Its heated lid works in combination with Opentrons single-use PCR lids or reusable rubber seals to help ensure efficient plate heating, protect samples against contamination, and reduce sample loss from evaporation.</p>